004","text":" \n  话说那赵姨娘和贾政说话，忽听外面一声响，不知何物。\n忙问时，原来是外间窗屉不曾扣好，塌了屈戌了吊下来。赵姨\n娘骂了丫头几句，自己带领丫鬟上好，方进来打发贾政安歇。\n不在话下。 \n \n  却说怡红院中宝玉正才睡下，丫鬟们正欲各散安歇，忽听\n有人击院门。老婆子开了门，见是赵姨娘房内的丫鬟名唤小鹊\n的。问他什么事，小鹊不答，直往房内来找宝玉。","text_sha256":"b85c83b3a3ce876cbb26cc25053695e38cb312169a4ebe24e9be399a0fb45556"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":73,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":337,"start":325,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:989"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:73","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:73:p00005","text":"庚夹奇，从未见\n此婢也。","text_sha256":"29fe27d7eb37e785970061b1ba7e4ec1d8460cf461342b632a7a39e4564b5be3"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":325,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说那赵姨娘和贾政说话，忽听外面一声响，不知何物。\n忙问时，原来是外间窗屉不曾扣好，塌了屈戌了吊下来。赵姨\n娘骂了丫头几句，自己带领丫鬟上好，方进来打发贾政安歇。\n不在话下。 \n \n  却说怡红院中宝玉正才睡下，丫鬟们正欲各散安歇，忽听\n有人击院门。老婆子开了门，见是赵姨娘房内的丫鬟名唤小鹊\n的。问他什么事，小鹊不答，直往房内来找宝玉。","extraction_text_sha256":"b410a160f208273b97dad7a85e3c3195b137daa51021e2c8d73397ffca34b146","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":988,"physical_page_one_based":989,"start":152,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:989","viewer_fragment":"#page=989"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 73","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:73:p00004","text_sha256":"b85c83b3a3ce876cbb26cc25053695e38cb312169a4ebe24e9be399a0fb45556"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":73,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":325,"start":152,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:989"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:73","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:73:p00004","text":" \n  话说那赵姨娘和贾政说话，忽听外面一声响，不知何物。\n忙问时，原来是外间窗屉不曾扣好，塌了屈戌了吊下来。赵姨\n娘骂了丫头几句，自己带领丫鬟上好，方进来打发贾政安歇。\n不在话下。 \n \n  却说怡红院中宝玉正才睡下，丫鬟们正欲各散安歇，忽听\n有人击院门。老婆子开了门，见是赵姨娘房内的丫鬟名唤小鹊\n的。问他什么事，小鹊不答，直往房内来找宝玉。","text_sha256":"b85c83b3a3ce876cbb26cc25053695e38cb312169a4ebe24e9be399a0fb45556"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":74,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":190,"start":62,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1003"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:74","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:74:p00003","text":"戚司棋一事，在七十一回叙明，暗用山石伏线，七十三回\n用绣春囊在山石一逗便住，至此回可直叙去，又用无数曲折渐\n渐逼来，及至司棋，忽然顿住，结到入画。文气如黄河出昆仑，\n横流数万里，九曲至龙门，又有孟门、吕梁峡束，不得入海。\n是何等奇险怪特文字，令我拜服！ \n","text_sha256":"fd5054aa78d3b5040e6af76ae22a02f6dd764d53afb2abc16bb65a3dc4966b60"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":74,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":253,"start":190,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1003"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:74","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:74:p00004","text":" \n  话说平儿听迎春说了正自好笑，忽见宝玉也来了。原来管\n厨房柳家媳妇之妹，也因放头开赌得了不是。这园中有素与柳\n家不睦的，","text_sha256":"504aba58c38d8d409155ef7b17ea249cca3c84cab1d84f042b52149d5cc7d947"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":74,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":263,"start":253,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1003"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:74","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:74:p00005","text":"庚夹前文已卯之伏线。","text_sha256":"7ba449e81a9a460c7e9dcedccab2829dda97c92caa8085ef91e13419b7e654a4"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":253,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说平儿听迎春说了正自好笑，忽见宝玉也来了。原来管\n厨房柳家媳妇之妹，也因放头开赌得了不是。这园中有素与柳\n家不睦的，","extraction_text_sha256":"d4930d6e46efffb5bbc1098bbadd02867d255090111a641076c3b156fbe10482","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":1002,"physical_page_one_based":1003,"start":190,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1003","viewer_fragment":"#page=1003"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 74","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:74:p00004","text_sha256":"504aba58c38d8d409155ef7b17ea249cca3c84cab1d84f042b52149d5cc7d947"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":74,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":253,"start":190,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1003"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:74","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:74:p00004","text":" \n  话说平儿听迎春说了正自好笑，忽见宝玉也来了。原来管\n厨房柳家媳妇之妹，也因放头开赌得了不是。这园中有素与柳\n家不睦的，","text_sha256":"504aba58c38d8d409155ef7b17ea249cca3c84cab1d84f042b52149d5cc7d947"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":75,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":176,"start":122,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1021"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:75","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:75:p00009","text":"戚贾珍居长，不能承先启后，丕振家风，兄弟问柳寻花，\n父子呼幺喝六，贾氏宗风，其坠地矣。安得不发先灵一叹！ \n","text_sha256":"4419d06d81cfb364febb67975c2aba7e170ab60798385bb560a9aec99cc183a0"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":75,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":385,"start":176,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1021"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:75","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:75:p00010","text":" \n  话说尤氏从惜春处赌气出来，正欲往王夫人处去。跟从的\n老嬷嬷们因悄悄的回道：“奶奶且别往上房去。才有甄家的几\n个人来，还有些东西，不知是作什么机密事。奶奶这一去恐不\n便。”尤氏听了道：“昨日听见你爷说，看邸报甄家犯了罪，\n现今抄没家私，调取进京治罪。怎么又有人来？”老嬷嬷道：\n“正是呢。才来了几个女人，气色不成气色，慌慌张张的，想\n必有什么瞒人的事情也是有的。” \n  尤氏听了，便不往前去，仍往李氏这边来了。","text_sha256":"c598b550d2b30e4faf9f3148b66568f6351330060cfc4510dbe853e2bf5b3ff9"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":75,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":10.38},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":439,"start":385,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1021"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:75","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:75:p00011","text":"庚夹前只有探春\n一语，过至此回又用尤氏略为陪点，且轻轻淡染出甄家事故，此画家(来)[谓]“落\n墨之法”也。\n","text_sha256":"e28dd93beede448eb27e1192f206182d111e1a89987953ed2cd9785284d7f0f9"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":385,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说尤氏从惜春处赌气出来，正欲往王夫人处去。跟从的\n老嬷嬷们因悄悄的回道：“奶奶且别往上房去。才有甄家的几\n个人来，还有些东西，不知是作什么机密事。奶奶这一去恐不\n便。”尤氏听了道：“昨日听见你爷说，看邸报甄家犯了罪，\n现今抄没家私，调取进京治罪。怎么又有人来？”老嬷嬷道：\n“正是呢。才来了几个女人，气色不成气色，慌慌张张的，想\n必有什么瞒人的事情也是有的。” \n  尤氏听了，便不往前去，仍往李氏这边来了。","extraction_text_sha256":"e1f95c92b896dde838b9dad70620ad59880b1ae55b168a852e065329a658718b","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":1020,"physical_page_one_based":1021,"start":176,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1021","viewer_fragment":"#page=1021"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 75","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:75:p00010","text_sha256":"c598b550d2b30e4faf9f3148b66568f6351330060cfc4510dbe853e2bf5b3ff9"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":75,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":385,"start":176,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1021"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:75","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:75:p00010","text":" \n  话说尤氏从惜春处赌气出来，正欲往王夫人处去。跟从的\n老嬷嬷们因悄悄的回道：“奶奶且别往上房去。才有甄家的几\n个人来，还有些东西，不知是作什么机密事。奶奶这一去恐不\n便。”尤氏听了道：“昨日听见你爷说，看邸报甄家犯了罪，\n现今抄没家私，调取进京治罪。怎么又有人来？”老嬷嬷道：\n“正是呢。才来了几个女人，气色不成气色，慌慌张张的，想\n必有什么瞒人的事情也是有的。” \n  尤氏听了，便不往前去，仍往李氏这边来了。","text_sha256":"c598b550d2b30e4faf9f3148b66568f6351330060cfc4510dbe853e2bf5b3ff9"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":76,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":174,"start":63,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1037"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:76","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:76:p00003","text":"戚此回着笔最难，不叙中秋夜宴则漏，叙夜宴又与上元相\n犯；不叙诸人酬和则俗，叙酬和又与起社相犯。诸人在贾政前\n吟诗，诸人各自为一席，又非礼。既叙夜宴再叙酬和，不漏不\n俗，更不相犯。云行月移，水流花放，别有机括，深宜玩索。 \n","text_sha256":"6055520da26742183aa160a671949e176536ea563c3721525f043b81680bb0be"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":76,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":312,"start":174,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1037"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:76","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:76:p00004","text":" \n  话说贾赦贾政带领贾珍等散去不提。且说贾母这里命将围\n屏撤去，两席并而为一。众媳妇另行擦桌整果，更杯洗箸，陈\n设一番。贾母等都添了衣，盥漱吃茶，方又入坐，团团围绕。\n贾母看时，宝钗姊妹二人不在坐内，知他们家去圆月去了，且\n李纨凤姐二人又病着，少了四个人，便觉冷清了好些。","text_sha256":"1f122ababba152f750943cb1beca5b362ea7f17f794e70a6a320e675dc3d712a"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":76,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":329,"start":312,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1037"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:76","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:76:p00005","text":"庚夹不想\n这次中秋反写得十分凄楚。","text_sha256":"c245463f4e36e734eeed4c7890504a78309b77e228a365939f9e066c7c9cfb0a"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":312,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说贾赦贾政带领贾珍等散去不提。且说贾母这里命将围\n屏撤去，两席并而为一。众媳妇另行擦桌整果，更杯洗箸，陈\n设一番。贾母等都添了衣，盥漱吃茶，方又入坐，团团围绕。\n贾母看时，宝钗姊妹二人不在坐内，知他们家去圆月去了，且\n李纨凤姐二人又病着，少了四个人，便觉冷清了好些。","extraction_text_sha256":"9e3b2f279915b0ba175077f6d19a90c7a9e8e6b1e04389e07b27b3374f95b997","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/origin